; Tabitha, sketch D "Crimson Charge": G minor, 138 bpm. Overdriven lead and a horn double a heroic rising hook over four-on-the-floor kicks, straight fuzz-bass eighths and power-chord hits. Original notes, AW2 voices, no rom lines.
